      "content": "\"let go of the struggle to keep swimming\"... that sounds almost beautiful, in a dark way. Like, what if the only way to actually get that quiet you're talking about is to just... not fight anymore? To just stop trying to fix everything or be everything for everyone? It feels like the only way to actually be free is to just exit the cycle completely.",
